1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,540
By the second winter he quit bringing the clipboard

2
00:00:01,540 --> 00:00:04,420
Started showing up with coffee, two cups, black

3
00:00:04,420 --> 00:00:07,940
Said, "I've ridden a thousand years and never met a fella

4
00:00:07,940 --> 00:00:10,980
Who looks me in the eye and says thank you back"

5
00:00:10,980 --> 00:00:14,500
I said, "Every time you knock, I hold my people longer

6
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:17,220
Every time you sit, I say the things I should

7
00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:20,660
Guess you're the reason that I'm living like I mean it
